  "contract": [
    "The registered technology array starts at database vector begin and copies every object ID in order.",
    "Native ID lookup searches real entries from vector index one and uses vector index zero as its fallback object.",
    "The technology database constructor resets the vector, creates its shared default technology with validity byte0x40 set to zero, and appends that pointer at the initial vector index zero.",
    "has_tech and set_technology reject unresolved pointers and objects with a false validity byte at offset0x40.",
    "The repair excludes array index zero, not a guessed token or numeric technology value; every real database vector entry remains eligible."
  ]
